# Wreckers' Cove's sea room (CIPlay wreckers_cove_cave; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe: kit_uw mouth on
# the sea floor at -20 -34 (pad -5; yaw 225: way in = -x -z), 4 pieces up 12 degrees (the cave tool's most; +6 m), the den
# beyond (middle ~-50.4 -64.4) under a new sea stack; air zone wc_seacave there, the chest wcseacavechest.
# 11-17 w15: rewritten as Keeper's Light's (w14F): swim to where the tunnel leaves the sea, walk the dry rest (below=5).
island Wreckers' Cove keep
offset -6.4468 -8.611
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
picture wc_seacave_out -2.3 6 -16.3 -50.4 3 -64.4
# (11-17 w15, lesson 170) swim in under water to where the tunnel leaves the sea, walk the dry rest, walk back, swim out
at -14.3 -28.3 h=-2
swim -14.3 -28.3 -3.5 to -20 -34 -3.5
walk -20 -34 to -26.4 -40.4 to -31.3 -45.3 to -34.1 -48.1 to -37 -51 to -40.6 -54.6 to -44.7 -58.7 to -48.3 -62.3 to -50.4 -64.4 below=-3
air wc_seacave here
picture wc_seacave_in -42.6 4 -56.6 -50.4 3 -64.4 light=20
open Wreckers' sea chest
wait 2
expect item TradeToken 3
walk -50.4 -64.4 to -48.3 -62.3 to -44.7 -58.7 to -40.6 -54.6 to -37 -51 to -34.1 -48.1 to -31.3 -45.3 to -26.4 -40.4 to -20 -34 below=5
